ly, uh, don't bother\"], [\"first appointment today?\", \"actually never mind\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0013\", \"v\": [[\"Could you please put the Holan photo in the Best of 2027 album?\", \"Thank you. Could you show me what else is in that album?\"], [\"add the Holan pic to my Best of 2027 album pls\", \"wat else is in that album\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0016\", \"v\": [[\"uh, when's my… the Malgorzata thing, when is that?\"], [\"Malgorzata thing, when?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0017\", \"v\": [[\"Malgorzata stuff?\"], [\"I've honestly lost track of everything going on lately, so what Malgorzata things do I have in here?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0018\", \"v\": [[\"when am i next seeing Penfuan Toth\", \"move the first one to thursday and the third one to tomorrow\"], [\"next with Penfuan Toth?\", \"first to thursday, third to tomorrow\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0019\", \"v\": [[\"umm so what've I… what have I still got to do?\"], [\"what's left to do?\"]]}\n{\"id\": \"w03-0020\", \"v\": [[\"Could you tell me what's overdue, please?\", \"Would you mind binning the parasol one?\", \"Also, could you show me my photos from November, please?\", \"Could you tell me how many that is, please?\"], [\"uh, what's… what's overdue?\", \"ok can you just bin the parasol one\", \"oh and um, can I see my photos from November?\", \"how many's that, like, in total?\"]]}","ttft_ms":18541,"type":"result","duration_ms":28985,"uuid":"a314ce29-38ff-4ed9-8be7-383a7b441dba","ttft_stream_ms":1759,"time_to_request_ms":279,"first_content_frame_ms":1759,"time_to_request_from_spawn_ms":21807367,"warm_spare_claimed":false,"time_origin_ms":1790278356903.163,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
